## CI/CD Pipelines

| Workflow | Trigger | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `publish.yml` | Push, PR, manual dispatch | Build/test/coverage/package; publishes snapshots and releases |
| `codeql.yml` | Schedule/Push | GitHub CodeQL security scanning |
| `scorecard.yml` | Schedule/Push | OpenSSF Scorecard supply-chain analysis |
| `osv-scanner.yml` | Schedule/Push/PR | Google OSV-Scanner dependency vuln scan |
| `reuse.yml` | Push/PR | FSFE REUSE license-compliance check |
| `claude-code-review.yml` | PR | AI-powered code review |
| `claude.yml` | Issue/PR comment with `@claude` | Claude Code interactive assistant |

